  m_text: 'The picker drives around the outside and presses ACTION near a parked
    truck: GOOSE! Both trucks race opposite ways around the marked loop to its vacant
    bay. Complete the loop, arrive upright and slow below 4 m/s to claim +1. The
    loser picks next. Highest score after the chosen rounds wins. Inner and outer
    lines permit physical passing; the central playground cannot bypass loop progress.
    A stranded racer returns to its last course angle after 8 seconds, losing only
    12 degrees of progress. Drive with your assigned controls; ACTION chooses the
    goose. Pause, view and rematch use the standard menus.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
